---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../components/shared/Container.astro";
import Title from "../components/shared/Title.astro";
import Paragraph from "../components/shared/Paragraph.astro";
import Pagebreadcrumb from "../components/shared/Pagebreadcrumb.astro";

import {
  ShieldCheck,
  Users,
  KeyRound,
  LockKeyhole,
  Activity,
  Terminal,
  BadgeCheck,
  ServerCog,
  Laptop,
  UserCog,
} from "lucide-astro";
import Requirement from "../components/sections/Requirement.astro";
import Selar from "../components/sections/Selar.astro";
---

<Layout title="Cloudnova - M365 Bootcamp - Week 4">
  <main class="flex flex-col gap-y-16 md:gap-y-24 overflow-hidden">
    <section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Background Effects -->
      <div
        class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 blur-3xl"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 h-[25rem] w-[25rem] rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 blur-3xl"
      >
      </div>

      <Container className="relative z-10">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
          <span
            class="inline-flex
          items-center
          gap-2
          rounded-full
          border
          border-indigo-500/20
          bg-indigo-500/10
          px-5
          py-2
          text-sm
          font-medium
          text-indigo-700
          dark:text-indigo-300
          backdrop-blur-xl"
          >
            <BadgeCheck size={18} />
            Week 4 Curriculum
          </span>

          <h1
            class="mt-8
          text-5xl/tight
          md:text-6xl/tight
          font-bold
          tracking-tight
          text-heading-1"
          >
            Microsoft
            <span
              class="text-transparent
            bg-clip-text
            bg-gradient-to-r
            from-indigo-600
            via-primary
            to-cyan-500"
            >
              Entra ID
            </span>
          </h1>

          <Paragraph className="mt-8 text-lg">
            Week 4 introduces students to Microsoft Entra ID, the identity and
            access management platform used in Microsoft 365. Students will
            learn how organizations manage identities, authentication, access
            control, security policies, and cloud-based identity protection.
          </Paragraph>

          <Pagebreadcrumb active="weekfour" />
        </div>

        <!-- Grid -->
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-20">
          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-blue-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <ShieldCheck size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Microsoft Entra ID Overview</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn what Microsoft Entra ID is and how it provides
              identity and access management for Microsoft 365 environments.
              This includes understanding cloud identities, authentication,
              authorization, and enterprise identity concepts.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/fundamentals/whatis"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Entra ID Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-sky-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <ServerCog size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Tenant Setup & Configuration</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn how organizations configure Entra ID tenants, domains,
              identity synchronization, and organizational settings. Students
              will understand how businesses structure their identity
              environments.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/fundamentals/how-to-create-first-tenant"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Tenant Configuration Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <Users size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Users & Group Management</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn how administrators create users, manage
              passwords, configure groups, assign licenses, and organize users
              within Microsoft 365 environments.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/fundamentals/how-to-create-delete-users"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              User Management Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-400 to-yellow-400 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <KeyRound size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Authentication Methods & MFA</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn how organizations secure accounts using authentication
              methods such as passwords, Microsoft Authenticator, SMS
              verification, and Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA). Students will
              understand why MFA is critical for security.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity/authentication/concept-mfa-howitworks"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              MFA Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-orange-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <LockKeyhole size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Conditional Access Policies</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn how organizations control access to
              applications using Conditional Access policies. Topics include
              location-based access, device compliance, MFA enforcement, and
              risk-based access control.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity/conditional-access/overview"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Conditional Access Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500 to-rose-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <ShieldCheck size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Identity Protection & Security</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn how Microsoft Entra ID helps organizations detect suspicious
              activities, risky sign-ins, compromised accounts, and
              identity-based threats. Students will understand the basics of
              identity protection.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/id-protection/overview-identity-protection"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Identity Protection Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-teal-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <Laptop size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Device Management Integration</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn how Microsoft Entra ID integrates with device
              management solutions such as Microsoft Intune. Topics include
              device registration, compliance, and secure access from managed
              devices.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/mem/intune/fundamentals/what-is-intune"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Intune Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-600 to-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <UserCog size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Roles & Administrative Units</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn how organizations delegate administrative responsibilities
              using roles and administrative units. Students will understand
              role-based access control (RBAC) and how permissions are assigned
              securely.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity/role-based-access-control/"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              RBAC Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-green-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <Activity size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Monitoring, Auditing & Sign-In Logs</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn how administrators monitor sign-ins, review
              audit logs, track user activities, and investigate suspicious
              login attempts within Microsoft Entra ID.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity/monitoring-health/"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Monitoring & Audit Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-700 to-black text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <Terminal size={26} />
              </div>

              <Title>Automation & PowerShell Basics</Title>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will be introduced to Microsoft Graph and PowerShell
              basics for Entra ID administration. Learn how administrators
              automate repetitive tasks, manage users, generate reports, and
              simplify identity management operations.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/entra-powershell/"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Entra PowerShell Docs
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <Selar />
        <div class="pt-10">
          <Requirement />
        </div>
      </Container>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
